    "Result": "The farmer and the dress farmer Thomas has a cow.It gives milk every day. His wife, Rosa, sells the milk. One day Thomas asks Rosa to go to a dance. No, says Rosa, I don't have a dress. Thomas has an idea. He sells the cow and buys a beautiful dress for Rosa. Look at the new dress Rosa. We can go to the dance now. He says Rosa is angry. Our cow gives us milk every day we sell the milk and buy food. We can't eat the dress. We need our cow.Thomas buys his cow back.",
